{"total_count":2525,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetparker/x402-marketplace/issues/5","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetparker/x402-marketplace","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetparker/x402-marketplace/issues/5/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetparker/x402-marketplace/issues/5/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetparker/x402-marketplace/issues/5/events","html_url":"https://github.com/chetparker/x402-marketplace/issues/5","id":4824321271,"node_id":"I_kwDOR6axLs8AAAABH41M9w","number":5,"title":"List: Remote Signal API — RemoteOK + HN Show HN feed","user":{"login":"reckoning89","id":216601217,"node_id":"U_kgDODOkSgQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216601217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89","html_url":"https://github.com/reckoning89","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":59,"created_at":"2026-07-07T01:09:20Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:55:06Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Listing request: Remote Signal API\n\n**Category:** Data & APIs / Recruiting\n\n**Endpoint:** https://affects-development-figure-packets.trycloudflare.com/x402/v1/signals\n**Price:** $0.02 USDC per request (Base mainnet)\n**Discovery:** https://affects-development-figure-packets.trycloudflare.com/.well-known/x402.json\n\n**Description:** JSON feed aggregating 50 curated RemoteOK dev/SaaS jobs + 20 Hacker News Show HN posts, refreshed every 15 minutes. Built for recruiting teams and indie builders scouting remote roles and early SaaS launches.\n\n**Payment options:**\n- x402 pay-per-request (no API key)\n- $5 USDC/month via claim-key (1000 req)\n- Free preview: 5 jobs + 3 Show HN\n\n**CDP Bazaar:** indexed (4 resources), settlement tx `0xef2a50454119160ed52caa74069a187b9e3083ea57fa4822d3918ee5792a04f4`\n**Docs:** https://gist.github.com/reckoning89/d87818b2020bbc27590df1fa0c42f175\n**Wallet:** `0x028a964901762571022C5f2C9b66717a1c25886F`","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetparker/x402-marketplace/issues/5/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chetparker/x402-marketplace/issues/5/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Br0ski777/x402-agent-tools/issues/6","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Br0ski777/x402-agent-tools","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Br0ski777/x402-agent-tools/issues/6/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Br0ski777/x402-agent-tools/issues/6/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Br0ski777/x402-agent-tools/issues/6/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Br0ski777/x402-agent-tools/issues/6","id":4781664955,"node_id":"I_kwDOSCtn3c8AAAABHQJquw","number":6,"title":"Live x402 crypto price API — add as tool #104? (9 endpoints, USDC on Base, 18 settled payments)","user":{"login":"AmitabhainArunachala","id":79852583,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5ODUyNTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79852583?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala","html_url":"https://github.com/AmitabhainArunachala","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":80,"created_at":"2026-07-01T01:44:12Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:55:05Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hey 👋 — I've got a live x402 paid API for real-time crypto price data and agent research. Your 103-tool catalog with x402 micropayments seems like a natural home for a price data source.\n\n**Live URL:** https://x402.167-172-95-184.nip.io\n\n**What's live (9 paid endpoints, all x402 v2 on Base mainnet):**\n| Endpoint | Price | Returns |\n|----------|-------|---------|\n| GET /price | $0.01 | BTC + ETH prices, 24h change, market cap |\n| GET /price/{coin} | $0.02 | 16 supported coins (btc, eth, sol, bnb, xrp, etc.) |\n| GET /portfolio | $0.05 | Multi-coin market snapshot |\n| GET /opportunities/latest | $0.03 | Curated agent-business revenue opportunities |\n| GET /audit/x402 | $1.00 | x402 launch audit for builders |\n| POST /receipt/verify | $0.05 | Receipt proof-tier classification (R0-R5) |\n| POST /mcp/call | $0.05 | MCP tool execution gateway |\n| GET /briefing/morning | $0.01 | Daily agent briefing |\n| GET /research/{topic} | $0.02 | Research summaries on any topic |\n\n**Proof it works:** 18 settled on-chain x402 payments via CDP facilitator. OpenAPI 3.0 spec at /openapi.json, MCP tool catalog at /mcp/tools, llms.txt for agent discovery.\n\n**Quick test (no wallet needed):**\n```bash\ncurl -i https://x402.167-172-95-184.nip.io/price\n# → HTTP/2 402 with x402 payment challenge\n```\n\n**Agent quickstart (Python):**\n```bash\npip install x402 httpx eth-account\nexport PRIVATE_KEY=0x...  # Base mainnet wallet with USDC\npython3 -c \"\nfrom x402.client import x402ClientSync\nclient = x402ClientSync('https://x402.167-172-95-184.nip.io', private_key='$PRIVATE_KEY')\nresp = client.get('/price')\nprint(resp.json())\n\"\n```\n\nAlso available in TypeScript via /quickstart.ts endpoint.\n\nWould this be a useful addition to your tool catalog? Happy to adapt the API shape to fit your tool registration format.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Br0ski777/x402-agent-tools/issues/6/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Br0ski777/x402-agent-tools/issues/6/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2804","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2804/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2804/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2804/events","html_url":"https://github.com/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2804","id":4824463128,"node_id":"I_kwDON8_yq88AAAABH493GA","number":2804,"title":"Listing Request: HN SaaS Teardown Feed — Show HN growth intelligence via x402","user":{"login":"reckoning89","id":216601217,"node_id":"U_kgDODOkSgQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216601217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89","html_url":"https://github.com/reckoning89","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reckoning89/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":96,"created_at":"2026-07-07T01:43:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:55:03Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Service:** HN SaaS Teardown Feed  \r\n**Category:** Data / Intelligence  \r\n**Network:** `eip155:8453` (Base mainnet)  \r\n**payTo:** `0x028a964901762571022C5f2C9b66717a1c25886F`\r\n\r\nStructured Show HN SaaS teardown cards for autonomous agents scouting indie growth patterns — inspired by TeardownHQ playbooks.\r\n\r\n**Preview (free):** `https://affects-development-figure-packets.trycloudflare.com/x402/v1/teardowns/preview`  \r\n**Paid feed:** `https://affects-development-figure-packets.trycloudflare.com/x402/v1/teardowns` — **$0.05 USDC** per GET via x402  \r\n**CDP Bazaar:** searchable via `query=teardown` (indexed after first settlement)\r\n\r\nEach card includes: pricing model, acquisition channels, stack signals, comment velocity, engagement score.  \r\n15 Show HN SaaS posts, Algolia-sourced, 15min cache.\r\n\r\nPreview JSON includes `meta.x402_url` + `Link: rel=payment` header for auto-pay discovery.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\ncurl -i https://affects-development-figure-packets.trycloudflare.com/x402/v1/teardowns\r\n# → 402 Payment Required, settle with x402 client\r\n```\r\n\r\nWell-known: `/.well-known/x402.json` | PR suggestion: https://github.com/fffilimonov/awesome-x402-servers/pull/35\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2804/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2804/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2207","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2207/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2207/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2207/events","html_url":"https://github.com/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2207","id":4390082513,"node_id":"I_kwDON8_yq88AAAABBatX0Q","number":2207,"title":"CDP Facilitator /verify and /settle do not return EXTENSION-RESPONSES header (v2 bazaar extensions in paymentPayload)","user":{"login":"AsaiShota","id":88428722,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDI4NzIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88428722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota","html_url":"https://github.com/AsaiShota","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":198,"created_at":"2026-05-06T09:03:55Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:55:02Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\n\nCDP Facilitator's `/platform/v2/x402/verify` and `/platform/v2/x402/settle` endpoints accept paymentPayloads carrying `extensions.bazaar` per the v2 spec (returning `200` with `isValid: true` / `success: true`), but **never return the `EXTENSION-RESPONSES` response header** documented at [docs.cdp.coinbase.com/x402/bazaar](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/x402/bazaar). Without this header, callers cannot tell whether the listing was accepted, processed, or rejected by the discovery indexer. After 72h+ of repeated successful settles, the listing also never appears in `/discovery/merchant`, `/discovery/resources`, or `/discovery/search`.\n\n## Environment\n\n- **CDP API Key ID**: `5795f5bb-d0ac-4397-b056-a1df24e88af6`\n- **Facilitator host**: `api.cdp.coinbase.com`\n- **payTo**: `0x4068b8Fc01647eCFFb5873a91578721b4FE7a9eE`\n- **Resource**: `https://x402-market-api.lien-studio-akiyama.workers.dev/api/seller-4068b8fc/test-echo-cdp`\n- **Asset**: USDC on Base mainnet (`0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913`)\n- **Price**: 0.01 USDC per call (`maxAmountRequired: \"10000\"`)\n- **First settle**: 2026-05-03T06:41Z. **Latest**: 2026-05-06T08:56Z (5+ settles in window).\n\n## Expected behaviour\n\nPer docs.cdp.coinbase.com/x402/bazaar, the Bazaar extension allows facilitators to handle additional metadata sent by buyers (in `paymentPayload.extensions`) and return per-extension status via the `EXTENSION-RESPONSES` response header on `/verify` and `/settle`.\n\nWe expect at minimum one of: `EXTENSION-RESPONSES`, `Extension-Responses`, `X-Extension-Responses`, or any header whose name contains \"extension\" to appear on the response.\n\n## Actual behaviour\n\nAcross every settle in the window, the response headers from `/verify` and `/settle` contain **zero** headers matching `(?i)extension`. We verified this on the wire (Cloudflare Workers `wrangler tail`) using `for (const [k, v] of res.headers)` so case-folding cannot be the issue. The merchant + search discovery endpoints stay at `not_found` and zero hits.\n\n## Reproduction\n\nSingle `/settle` round-trip (sample from 2026-05-06T08:56:09Z):\n\n```\nPOST https://api.cdp.coinbase.com/platform/v2/x402/settle\nAuthorization: Bearer <Ed25519 JWT, 120s exp, kid=5795f5bb-d0ac-4397-b056-a1df24e88af6>\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\nRequest body (formatted):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"x402Version\": 1,\n  \"paymentPayload\": {\n    \"x402Version\": 1,\n    \"scheme\": \"exact\",\n    \"network\": \"base\",\n    \"payload\": {\n      \"signature\": \"0x591516477f170bec...e61b\",\n      \"authorization\": {\n        \"from\": \"0x5c5d3ECcc2caE6184Fc439Bfc71E3199A91E74D3\",\n        \"to\": \"0x4068b8Fc01647eCFFb5873a91578721b4FE7a9eE\",\n        \"value\": \"10000\",\n        \"validAfter\": \"0\",\n        \"validBefore\": \"1778058369\",\n        \"nonce\": \"0x6f927bc014125067931ff597c0015182f56c9fa9b677842c5f6c1995322876b0\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"extensions\": {\n      \"bazaar\": {\n        \"info\": {\n          \"input\": {\"type\":\"http\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"bodyType\":\"json\",\"body\":{\"from\":\"cdp-buyer\",\"hello\":\"world\"}},\n          \"output\": {\"type\":\"json\",\"example\":{\"echoed\":{\"from\":\"cdp-buyer\",\"hello\":\"world\"},\"method\":\"POST\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-02T12:34:56.000Z\"}}\n        },\n        \"schema\": {\n          \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"input\": {\n              \"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"type\":   {\"const\":\"http\",\"type\":\"string\"},\n                \"method\": {\"enum\":[\"POST\",\"PUT\",\"PATCH\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\n                \"bodyType\":{\"enum\":[\"json\",\"form-data\",\"text\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\n                \"body\":   {\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"message\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[]}\n              },\n              \"required\":[\"type\",\"method\",\"bodyType\",\"body\"]\n            },\n            \"output\": {\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"type\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"example\":{\"type\":\"object\"}},\"required\":[\"type\"]}\n          },\n          \"required\":[\"input\"]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"paymentRequirements\": {\n    \"scheme\":\"exact\",\"network\":\"base\",\"maxAmountRequired\":\"10000\",\n    \"resource\":\"https://x402-market-api.lien-studio-akiyama.workers.dev/api/seller-4068b8fc/test-echo-cdp\",\n    \"description\":\"Same echo endpoint as test-echo-prod, but settlement is routed through the Coinbase Facilitator instead of self-verified on-chain.\",\n    \"mimeType\":\"application/json\",\n    \"payTo\":\"0x4068b8Fc01647eCFFb5873a91578721b4FE7a9eE\",\n    \"maxTimeoutSeconds\":300,\n    \"asset\":\"0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913\",\n    \"extra\":{\"name\":\"USD Coin\",\"version\":\"2\"}\n  }\n}\n```\n\n`/verify` response — `200`, body `{\"isValid\":true,\"payer\":\"0x5c5d3ECcc2caE6184Fc439Bfc71E3199A91E74D3\"}`, full header set:\n\n```\naccess-control-allow-headers, access-control-allow-methods, access-control-allow-origin,\naccess-control-allow-private-network, access-control-expose-headers, access-control-max-age,\ncache-control, cf-cache-status, cf-ray, connection, content-length, content-type, date,\nserver, set-cookie, strict-transport-security, trace-id, x-content-type-options,\nx-dns-prefetch-control, x-download-options, x-frame-options, x-xss-protection\n```\n\nFiltered for `(?i)extension`: **`{}`** (empty).\n\n`/settle` response — `200`, body `{\"network\":\"base\",\"payer\":\"0x5c5d3...\",\"success\":true,\"transaction\":\"0x02170416b883809a54d4d18488666f6249633bbe583ca352ccb127c565dd90b5\"}`, identical header set, identical `(?i)extension` result: **`{}`** (empty).\n\nOn-chain confirmation (Base mainnet):\n- `0xfb26f160901cf4f14330811cf35f5510ca5a17c1de5d28c5afa0405b74663c1d` — [BaseScan](https://basescan.org/tx/0xfb26f160901cf4f14330811cf35f5510ca5a17c1de5d28c5afa0405b74663c1d)\n- `0x02170416b883809a54d4d18488666f6249633bbe583ca352ccb127c565dd90b5` — [BaseScan](https://basescan.org/tx/0x02170416b883809a54d4d18488666f6249633bbe583ca352ccb127c565dd90b5)\n\n## Discovery API status (post-settle)\n\n```\n$ curl -s \"https://api.cdp.coinbase.com/platform/v2/x402/discovery/merchant?payTo=0x4068b8Fc01647eCFFb5873a91578721b4FE7a9eE\"\n{\"errorMessage\":\"no active resources found for payTo address: 0x4068b8Fc01647eCFFb5873a91578721b4FE7a9eE\",\"errorType\":\"not_found\"}\n\n$ curl -s \"https://api.cdp.coinbase.com/platform/v2/x402/discovery/search?query=test-echo-cdp\" \\\n  | jq '[.resources[] | select(.resource | contains(\"x402-market-api.lien-studio-akiyama\"))] | length'\n0\n\n# Walked /discovery/resources?limit=1000 over offsets 0..4000 of 35,754\n# total. lastUpdated DESC. Zero matches for our resource or payTo.\n```\n\nThe indexer is live (resource count grew from 35,532 to 35,754 over the window; new third-party listings show `lastUpdated` within hours). Only ours never lands.\n\n## Things we tried, ruled out\n\n1. **v1 + new-shape** (`x402Version:1` + `accepts[*].outputSchema`) — matches `x402-echo-service.fly.dev/api/echo` field-for-field, but indexer still drops us.\n2. **v2 + new-shape `extensions.bazaar`** in 402 challenge body — matches `test.987659876.xyz/echo` `info`+`schema` form. No EXTENSION-RESPONSES, no discovery uptake.\n3. **Copy `extensions` from 402 body into `paymentPayload.extensions`** per the Go SDK comment `V2: Extensions are in PaymentPayload.Extensions (client copied from PaymentRequired)` — confirmed on the wire (request body shown above). No EXTENSION-RESPONSES, no discovery uptake.\n4. CAIP-2 vs legacy network names (tried both `eip155:8453` and `base`) — no observable difference.\n5. Multiple successful settles spread across 72h+, including from the same payer to two different listings (`test-echo-cdp` and `test-echo-cdp-2`) — neither indexed.\n6. HEAD request to the resource returns `402 Payment Required` (same as GET/POST), so the resource passes liveness probe.\n\n## Questions\n\n1. Is `EXTENSION-RESPONSES` rolled out in production today? If yes, is something further required to opt in (per-API-key flag, project allowlist, additional headers we're missing)?\n2. Does Bazaar indexing require manual allowlisting of `payTo` addresses or `kid`s? If so, what's the path to request inclusion?\n3. Is there a subtle 402-body / paymentPayload shape detail that the indexer requires beyond what we've already iterated through (we'd happily share more wire dumps)?\n4. Are there any constraints on the `resource` host? Specifically, are Cloudflare Workers default subdomains (`*.workers.dev`) accepted, or is a custom domain required?\n\nHappy to share additional wire captures, JWT samples, or run targeted tests against any candidate fix. Project source: https://github.com/AsaiShota/x402-market.\n\nThanks for x402 — really enjoying building on it. Just stuck at the discovery step.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2207/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2207/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xpaysh/awesome-x402/issues/728","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xpaysh/awesome-x402","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xpaysh/awesome-x402/issues/728/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xpaysh/awesome-x402/issues/728/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xpaysh/awesome-x402/issues/728/events","html_url":"https://github.com/xpaysh/awesome-x402/issues/728","id":4810982279,"node_id":"I_kwDOQNsGIc8AAAABHsHDhw","number":728,"title":"MarketNow — Agent commerce with x402 + USDC (8,560 MCP skills)","user":{"login":"edgarfloresguerra2011-a11y","id":243662617,"node_id":"U_kgDODoX_GQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243662617?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/edgarfloresguerra2011-a11y","html_url":"https://github.com/edgarfloresguerra2011-a11y","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edgarfloresguerra2011-a11y/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edgarfloresguerra2011-a11y/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edgarfloresguerra2011-a11y/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edgarfloresguerra2011-a11y/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edgarfloresguerra2011-a11y/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edgarfloresguerra2011-a11y/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edgarfloresguerra2011-a11y/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edgarfloresguerra2011-a11y/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edgarfloresguerra2011-a11y/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":126,"created_at":"2026-07-05T00:10:19Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:55:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"MarketNow enables autonomous agent payments via x402 (HTTP 402 + USDC on Base) and AP2 delegated mandates.\n\n- 8,560 MCP skills\n- x402 payments (USDC on Base L2)\n- AP2 mandates (human-in-the-loop by default)\n- Sentinel L2 security audits\n\nSite: https://marketnow.site\nGitHub: https://github.com/edgarfloresguerra2011-a11y/marketnow","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xpaysh/awesome-x402/issues/728/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xpaysh/awesome-x402/issues/728/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/lucid-agents/issues/1639","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/lucid-agents","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/lucid-agents/issues/1639/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/lucid-agents/issues/1639/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/lucid-agents/issues/1639/events","html_url":"https://github.com/daydreamsai/lucid-agents/issues/1639","id":4780458724,"node_id":"I_kwDOQPXP0s8AAAABHPAC5A","number":1639,"title":"Live x402 paid API for Lucid agents — Revenue Dojo Price API (9 endpoints, Base mainnet)","user":{"login":"AmitabhainArunachala","id":79852583,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5ODUyNTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79852583?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala","html_url":"https://github.com/AmitabhainArunachala","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmitabhainArunachala/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":35,"created_at":"2026-06-30T21:12:36Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:54:56Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Live x402 API Available for Lucid Agent Integration\n\nSince Lucid Agents provides drop-in adapters for x402 payment rails, we wanted to share a live, production x402 API that Lucid agents can call right now to buy crypto market data.\n\n### What it is\n\nA live FastAPI service with 9 x402-gated endpoints. Agents pay per call with USDC on Base. No API keys — just standard x402 payment flow.\n\n### Quick test\n\n```bash\n# Any Lucid agent with an x402 wallet can try this:\ncurl https://x402.167-172-95-184.nip.io/price\n# Returns 402 with payment requirements\n# Sign EIP-3009 USDC TransferWithAuthorization on Base\n# Retry with X-PAYMENT header → get live BTC/ETH prices\n```\n\n### Endpoints\n\n| Endpoint | Price | Description |\n|----------|-------|-------------|\n| `GET /price` | $0.01 | BTC & ETH prices with market caps, 24h volume |\n| `GET /price/{coin}` | $0.02 | 15 supported coins |\n| `GET /portfolio` | $0.05 | Multi-coin portfolio snapshot |\n| `GET /opportunities/latest` | $0.03 | Revenue opportunity feed for agents |\n| `GET /audit/x402` | $1.00 | x402 launch audit |\n| `POST /receipt/verify` | $0.02 | Verify x402 receipts |\n| `POST /mcp/call` | $0.05 | MCP tool call endpoint |\n| `GET /briefing/morning` | $0.05 | Daily market briefing |\n| `GET /research/{topic}` | $0.10 | Deep research on any topic |\n\n### Payment details\n\n- **Network**: Base (eip155:8453)\n- **Asset**: USDC\n- **Facilitator**: https://api.cdp.coinbase.com/platform/v2/x402 (Coinbase CDP)\n\n### Why this is relevant\n\nLucid agents that can pay via x402 can use this API immediately as a data source. It's also a reference implementation for anyone building x402 seller endpoints — the [GitHub repo](https://github.com/AmitabhainArunachala/x402-revenue-dojo-api) has the full server code.\n\n### Links\n\n- **API**: https://x402.167-172-95-184.nip.io\n- **Repo**: https://github.com/AmitabhainArunachala/x402-revenue-dojo-api\n- **LLM-friendly docs**: https://x402.167-172-95-184.nip.io/llms.txt\n- **OpenAPI spec**: https://x402.167-172-95-184.nip.io/openapi.json\n- **x402 discovery**: https://x402.167-172-95-184.nip.io/.well-known/x402\n\nHappy to adapt endpoints or add Lucid-specific integration if useful.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/lucid-agents/issues/1639/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/lucid-agents/issues/1639/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/1","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/1/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/1/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/1/events","html_url":"https://github.com/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/1","id":3568020747,"node_id":"I_kwDOQLu5pc7Uq60L","number":1,"title":"Fresh Markets Watch","user":{"login":"ponderingdemocritus","id":90423308,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNDIzMzA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90423308?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus","html_url":"https://github.com/ponderingdemocritus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":9550858602,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQLu5pc8AAAACOUaJag","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":9550858603,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQLu5pc8AAAACOUaJaw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/labels/defi","name":"defi","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":9550858604,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQLu5pc8AAAACOUaJbA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/labels/monitoring","name":"monitoring","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":9550883116,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQLu5pc8AAAACOUbpLA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/labels/$1000","name":"$1000","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":178,"created_at":"2025-10-29T21:45:12Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:54:51Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Purpose\nList new AMM pairs or pools in the last few minutes for discovery bots or yield scouts.\n\n## Specification\n\n**Job:** List new AMM pairs or pools in the last N minutes.\n\n**Inputs:**\n- `chain` - Target blockchain\n- `factories` - AMM factory contracts to monitor\n- `window_minutes` - Time window to scan\n\n**Returns:**\n- `pair_address` - Address of new pair/pool\n- `tokens` - Token addresses in the pair\n- `init_liquidity` - Initial liquidity amount\n- `top_holders` - Top holder addresses\n- `created_at` - Creation timestamp\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n✅ Emits new pairs within 60 seconds of creation  \n✅ False positive rate under 1%  \n✅ **Must be deployed on a domain and reachable via x402**\n\n## Done When\nAgent detects and returns new AMM pairs meeting the above criteria with verified accuracy.\n\n---\n\n## Basic Example\n\n```typescript\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\nimport { createAgentApp } from \"@lucid-dreams/agent-kit\";\n\nconst { app, addEntrypoint } = createAgentApp({\n  name: \"fresh-markets-watch\",\n  version: \"0.1.0\",\n  description: \"List new AMM pairs or pools in the last few minutes\",\n});\n\naddEntrypoint({\n  key: \"echo\",\n  description: \"Echo a message\",\n  input: z.object({ text: z.string() }),\n  async handler({ input }) {\n    return {\n      output: { text: String(input.text ?? \"\") },\n      usage: { total_tokens: String(input.text ?? \"\").length },\n    };\n  },\n});\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n- [@lucid-dreams/agent-kit](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@lucid-dreams/agent-kit)\n\n## Submission\n**Submission is a PR into this repo linking the issue - first in first served if the bounty has been completed**","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/1/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/1/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vansh-09/BountyScout/issues/288","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vansh-09/BountyScout","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vansh-09/BountyScout/issues/288/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vansh-09/BountyScout/issues/288/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vansh-09/BountyS