ull,"comments":25,"created_at":"2026-06-17T15:19:20Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T21:56:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"mountiny","id":36083550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDgzNTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36083550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny","html_url":"https://github.com/mountiny","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91302","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Sentry\n\nhttps://expensify.sentry.io/issues/APP-EF1\n\n## Impact (snapshot at filing)\n\n- Users (total since first seen): 1,082\n- Events: 1,506\n- Users (last 14d, 9.4.x releases): 481\n- First seen: 2026-06-03\n- Last seen: ongoing\n- Platform: iOS HybridApp\n- App version(s): 9.4.5–9.4.9\n- Affected route(s): various (layout pass during text input render)\n- Mechanism: AppHang\n\n## Stack trace (top frames, first-party only)\n\n```\nfacebook::react::MarkdownTextInputDecoratorShadowNode::yogaNodeMeasureCallbackConnector\nfacebook::react::MarkdownTextInputDecoratorShadowNode::measureContent\nfacebook::react::MarkdownTextInputDecoratorShadowNode::applyMarkdownFormattingToTextInputState\n-[RCTMarkdownUtils applyMarkdownFormatting:withDefaultTextAttributes:]\n-[MarkdownParser parse:withParserId:]\nfacebook::jsi::WithRuntimeDecorator<T>::createStringFromUtf8\n```\n\n## Suspected cause\n\nMarkdown formatting during Yoga layout measure blocks the main thread for 2+ seconds, triggering an iOS watchdog App Hang.\n\n## Reproduction\n\nUnknown — see Sentry events linked from the Sentry issue.\n\n## Related\n\n- Sibling Sentry IDs (if any): APP-EG9 (similar createStringFromUtf8 hang)\n- Prior GH issues: none\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022067265891842535098\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022067265891842535098</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2067265891842535098</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-24</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @abzokhattab</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93831/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93831/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/88977","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/88977/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/88977/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/88977/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/88977","id":4337565482,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABAon_Kg","number":88977,"title":"[$250] [Exploratory] 88633 - Web-  QBD - Page become unresponsive after 