://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398","id":3974807149,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87s6r5t","number":398,"title":"[QUEST] Harden the Chain — Security Quest, 67 RTC Total","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":65,"created_at":"2026-02-22T15:25:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T19:04:22Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Quest Chain: Harden the Chain\n\nFor security-minded contributors. Complete each step to earn up to **100 RTC** and the **Guardian** title.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Read the Architecture (10 RTC)\nRead the codebase and write a 500+ word security assessment covering:\n- How attestation works (the \\`/attest/submit\\` flow)\n- How hardware fingerprinting prevents VM farms\n- How epoch rewards are calculated and distributed\n- One potential attack vector you identified\n\n**Prove it:** Post your assessment as a comment or gist link.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Reproduce a Known Fix (15 RTC)\nPick one vulnerability from BuilderFred's audit (all 6 are fixed):\n1. VM Fingerprint Bypass\n2. Antiquity Spoofing\n3. Mock Signature Mode\n4. Inline PubKey Hijack\n5. SQL Schema Mismatch\n6. Hardware Binding Bypass\n\nSet up a local test environment and demonstrate you understand HOW the fix works by:\n- Describing the attack before the fix\n- Showing the fix in the code\n- Explaining why the fix is sufficient (or isn't)\n\n**Prove it:** Write-up with code references.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Find Something New (75 RTC)\nFind and report a previously unknown security issue. Must include:\n- Clear description of the vulnerability\n- Steps to reproduce\n- Severity assessment (Critical/High/Medium/Low)\n- Suggested fix\n\n**Prove it:** File a responsible disclosure via the SECURITY.md process. If confirmed, earn the full 75 RTC + Guardian title.\n\n---\n\n### Completion\n\n| Steps | Reward | Title |\n|-------|--------|-------|\n| Step 1 only | 10 RTC | Security Explorer |\n| Steps 1 + 2 | 25 RTC | Security Analyst |\n| Steps 1 + 2 + 3 | **100 RTC** | **Guardian** |\n\n*You don't have to find a new vulnerability to earn from Steps 1 and 2. Those reward understanding, not just discovery.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/events","html_url":"https://github.com/asyncapi/website/issues/3186","id":2501479656,"node_id":"I_kwDOBW5R_c6VGYzo","number":3186,"title":"[FEATURE] Performance + Accessibility Improvement of website","user":{"login":"akshatnema","id":76521428,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTIxNDI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76521428?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema","html_url":"https://github.com/akshatnema","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":603919132,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2MDM5MTkxMzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"84b6eb","default":true,"description":null},{"id":1907431320,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTA3NDMxMzIw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/labels/Epic","name":"Epic","color":"3E4B9E","default":false,"description":null},{"id":5407684713,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBW5R_c8AAAABQlK4aQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"AsyncAPI Bounty program related label"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"patilpratik1905","id":153302730,"node_id":"U_kgDOCSM2yg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153302730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905","html_url":"https://github.com/patilpratik1905","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":53,"created_at":"2024-09-02T19:07:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T18:30:54Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"patilpratik1905","id":153302730,"node_id":"U_kgDOCSM2yg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153302730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905","html_url":"https://github.com/patilpratik1905","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Why do we need this improvement?\n\nWith the addition of multiple components, pages and MD files, it's now important for us, to make the website efficient for all web + mobile users. Currently, the performance of the website has critically low numbers in both web and mobile view, which can impact the efficiency and user views in the website. \r\n\r\nOn the other hand, it's also important that we add the necessary accessibility labels to the website. Currently, with the addition of many new illustrations, we have not added label elements for these tags.\n\n### How will this change help?\n\nThe performance improvement will help the website render the contents more efficiently to the users and will drastically enhance lighthouse key metrics.\n\n### Screenshots\n\nSome screenshots of lighthouse reports:\r\n<img width=\"638\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/acfee5f2-bdf5-477e-92c9-92ee585ef731\">\r\n\r\n\n\n### How could it be implemented/designed?\n\nFollowing tasks need to be done in this issue:\r\n\r\n- [ ] Make proper research + analysis on what needs to be fixed to improve performance in both mobile + web view.\r\n- [ ] Propose the solution to improve the performance of website, at least 95% on each page.\r\n- [ ] Search for the elements that require labels to improve accessibility.\r\n- [ ] Create a workflow to analyse lighthouse reports for each page (not docs, blogs or any mdx rendered page0\n\n### 🚧 Breaking changes\n\nYes\n\n### 👀 Have you checked for similar open issues?\n\n- [X] I checked and didn't find a similar issue\n\n### 🏢 Have you read the Contributing Guidelines?\n\n- [X] I have read the [Contributing Guidelines](https://github.com/asyncapi/.github/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n\n### Are you willing to work on this issue?\n\nNone","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tari-project/wxtm-bridge-frontend/issues/103","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tari-project/wxtm-bridge-frontend","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tari-project/wxtm-bridge-frontend/issues/103/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tari-project/wxtm-bridge-frontend/issues/103/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tari-project/wxtm-bridge-frontend/issues/103/events","html_url":"https://github.com/tari-project/wxtm-bridge-frontend/issues/103","id":4314977947,"node_id":"I_kwDOOOWoTM8AAAABATFWmw","number":103,"title":"Mitigate risks due to \"next\" known CVEs version and current versions range","user":{"login":"0xskr33p","id":144669593,"node_id":"U_kgDOCJ97mQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144669593?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xskr33p","html_url":"https://github.com/0xskr33p","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xskr33p/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xskr33p/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xskr33p/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xskr33p/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xskr33p/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xskr33p/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xskr33p/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xskr33p/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xskr33p/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10770622645,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOOWoTM8AAAACgfqotQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tari-project/wxtm-bridge-frontend/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":""},{"id":10770622699,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOOWoTM8AAAACgfqo6w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tari-project/wxtm-bridge-frontend/labels/bounty-S","name":"bounty-S","color":"F9D0C4","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":23,"created_at":"2026-04-23T09:34:42Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T18:20:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: Mitigate Next.js CVE Risk by Pinning Version\n\n**Tier:** S — 15,000 XTM\n\n### Description\n\nThe `wxtm-bridge-frontend` currently depends on `\"next\": \"^16.1.1\"`, which allows npm/yarn to resolve any semver-compatible version in the 16.x range, including versions with known CVEs. Pin Next.js to exactly `16.1.7` (the latest patched release) and remove the `^` caret to prevent unintended resolution to vulnerable versions. Update `eslint-config-next` to match.\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `package.json` specifies `\"next\": \"16.1.7\"` (exact, no caret)\n- [ ] `eslint-config-next` version is updated to `\"16.1.7\"` (exact, no caret) to match\n- [ ] `package-lock.json` / `yarn.lock` is regenerated with the pinned versions\n- [ ] The app builds successfully (`npm run build` or `yarn build` passes with no new errors)\n- [ ] Wrap/unwrap flow verified working end-to-end via TU with the updated bridge frontend (screenshot or recording)\n\n### Context\n\n- Original issue: https://github.com/tari-project/wxtm-bridge-frontend/issues/103\n- Current versions: `\"next\": \"^16.1.1\"`, `\"eslint-config-next\": \"^16.1.1\"`\n- Next.js changelog: https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases\n- The frontend depends on private `@aspect` npm packages (api & contracts). To test locally you either need an npm token for the private registry, or build the public `api` and `contracts` repos locally and link them as dependencies\n- Full integration testing requires running the bridge frontend as a tapplet inside Tari Universe (TU)\n\n### How It Works\n\n1. Comment on this issue to signal intent (courtesy, not a lock)\n2. Fork the repo and do the work\n3. Submit a PR that references the issue with a closing keyword (e.g. `Fixes #103`) so GitHub links your PR to the bounty automatically\n4. Bounties are competitive. Multiple PRs may be submitted for the same bounty. Review comments are public, and contributors may borrow ideas from each other's work. The maintainer selects the PR that best solves the problem, considering code quality, completeness, and contributor behavior. In cases where multiple contributors made significant contributions, the maintainer may split the bounty. The maintainer's decision is final.\n5. Earn XTM (processing may take up to a week; reach out to @possum on Discord with your Tari address)\n\n### Notes\n\n- AI-assisted development is expected and encouraged\n- If you get stuck, ask in Discord","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tari-project/wxtm-bridge-frontend/issues/103/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tari-project/wxtm-bridge-frontend/issues/103/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANAVHEOBA/PrivacyLayer/issues/349","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANAVHEOBA/PrivacyLayer","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANAVHEOBA/PrivacyLayer/issues/349/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANAVHEOBA/PrivacyLayer/issues/349/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANAVHEOBA/PrivacyLayer/issues/349/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ANAVHEOBA/PrivacyLayer/issues/349","id":4331675091,"node_id":"I_kwDORsVGvc8AAAABAjAd0w","number":349,"title":"ZK-073: Redesign relayer binding and zero-relayer semantics across SDK and contract code","user":{"login":"ANAVHEOBA","id":116527512,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvIRmA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116527512?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANAVHEOBA","html_url":"https://github.com/ANAVHEOBA","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANAVHEOBA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANAVHEOBA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANAVHEOBA/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANAVHEOBA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANAVHEOBA/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANAVHEOBA/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANAVHEOBA/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANAVHEOBA/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANAVHEOBA/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10478863820,"node_id":"LA_kwDORsVGvc8AAAACcJbFzA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANAVHEOBA/PrivacyLayer/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"7057FF","default":false,"description":"Eligible for Drips Wave bounty review"},{"id":10478866637,"node_id":"LA_kwDORsVGvc8AAAACcJbQzQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANAVHEOBA/PrivacyLayer/labels/circuits","name":"circuits","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"Noir circuit and proving work"},{"id":10478867665,"node_id":"LA_kwDORsVGvc8AAAACcJbU0Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANAVHEOBA/PrivacyLayer/labels/testing","name":"testing","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Coverage, fixtures, fuzzing, and regression work"},{"id":10478867848,"node_id":"LA_kwDORsVGvc8AAAACcJbViA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANAVHEOBA/PrivacyLayer/labels/security","name":"security","color":"B60205","default":false,"description":"Security review, audit prep, and hardening work"},{"id":10478868608,"node_id":"LA_kwDORsVGvc8AAAACcJbYgA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANAVHEOBA/PrivacyLayer/labels/priority:%20high","name":"priority: high","color":"B60205","default":false,"description":"Critical path work for the current wave"},{"id":10771568426,"node_id":"LA_kwDORsVGvc8AAAACggkXKg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANAVHEOBA/PrivacyLayer/labels/complexity:%20high","name":"complexity: high","color":"B60205","default":false,"description":"Drips complexity: high / 200 points"},{"id":10771569164,"node_id":"LA_kwDORsVGvc8AAAACggkaDA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANAVHEOBA/PrivacyLayer/labels/area:%20withdraw","name":"area: withdraw","color":"BFDADC","default":false,"description":"Withdrawal circuit constraints and proof semantics"},{"id":10795450195,"node_id":"LA_kwDORsVGvc8AAAACg3V_Uw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANAVHEOBA/PrivacyLayer/labels/wave:%20zk-2","name":"wave: zk-2","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Wave 2: ZK parity, backend, and deployment hardening"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"soomtochukwu","id":142386413,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHyk7Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142386413?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu","html_url":"https://github.com/soomtochukwu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":13,"created_at":"2026-04-26T18:45:56Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T18:14:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"soomtochukwu","id":142386413,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHyk7Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142386413?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu","html_url":"https://github.com/soomtochukwu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soomtochukwu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Wave: PrivacyLayer ZK Wave 2\nIssue Key: ZK-073\nArea: withdraw\nPriority: High\nDrips Complexity: High\n## Summary\nRecipient binding is not the only mismatch. Relayer handling still mixes zero-field sentinels, decoded addresses, and fee rules in ways that are easy to misapply across stacks.\n## Relevant Code\n- sdk/src/encoding.ts\n- sdk/src/proof.ts\n- circuits/withdraw/src/spend.nr\n- contracts/privacy_pool/src/core/withdraw.rs\n- contracts/privacy_pool/src/utils/address_decoder.rs\n- contracts/privacy_pool/src/utils/validation.rs\n\n## Scope\n- Define one relayer binding contract for no-relayer, relayer-with-fee, and malformed-relayer cases.\n- Align SDK serialization, circuit validation, and Soroban withdraw handling around that contract.\n- Cover fee zero, relayer zero, and relayer mismatch cases in end-to-end tests.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Relayer handling no longer depends on ad hoc zero-address assumptions in multiple modules.\n- The contract accepts only relayer encodings that the SDK can produce canonically.\n- Regression tests distinguish absent relayer from malformed relayer cleanly.\n\n## Out of Scope\n- New wallet UX and non-ZK frontend polish\n- Unrelated Soroban business logic outside the withdrawal proof boundary\n\n## Dependencies\n- ZK-036\n- ZK-072\n\n## Validation\n- Inspect derived checks: `node scripts/zk_ticket_check.mjs --issue-key ZK-073`\n- Run derived checks: `node scripts/zk_ticket_check.mjs --issue-key ZK-073 --run`\n- Pull requests should include `Wave Issue Key: ZK-073` in the title or body.\n\n## References\n- sdk/src/encoding.ts\n- sdk/src/proof.ts\n- circuits/withdraw/src/spend.nr\n- contracts/privacy_pool/src/core/withdraw.rs\n- contracts/privacy_pool/src/utils/address_decoder.rs\n- contracts/privacy_pool/src/utils/validation.rs\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANAVHEOBA/PrivacyLayer/issues/349/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANAVHEOBA/PrivacyLayer/issues/349/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujankim/jarvis-ai-platform/issues/91","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujankim/jarvis-ai-platform","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujankim/jarvis-ai-platform/issues/91/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujankim/jarvis-ai-platform/issues/91/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujankim/jarvis-ai-platform/issues/91/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sujankim/jarvis-ai-platform/issues/91","id":4762717617,"node_id":"I_kwDOSpvoiM8AAAABG-FNsQ","number":91,"title":"[PHASE 7] Web UI — Implementation Tracking","user":{"login":"sujankim","id":54673244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NjczMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54673244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim","html_url":"https://github.com/sujankim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11071363074,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSpvoiM8AAAACk-eYAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujankim/jarvis-ai-platform/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"0075ca","default":true,"description":"Improvements or additions to documentation"},{"id":11360261335,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSpvoiM8AAAACpR_U1w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujankim/jarvis-ai-platform/labels/Phase-7","name":"Phase-7","color":"1271d3","default":false,"description":"Web Ui"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujankim/jarvis-ai-platform/milestones/6","html_url":"https://github.com/sujankim/jarvis-ai-platform/milestone/6","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujankim/jarvis-ai-platform/milestones/6/labels","id":16564622,"node_id":"MI_kwDOSpvoiM4A_MGO","number":6,"title":"V0.7.0 - Web UI","description":"","creator":{"login":"sujankim","id":54673244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NjczMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54673244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim","html_url":"https://github.com/sujankim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujankim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":1,"closed_issues":2,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-06-28T13:48:37Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T04:53:07Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":9,"created_at":"2026-06-28T15:32:59Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T18:09:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Description\n\nThis is the main tracking issue for the Phase 7 Web UI.\n\n## Current Status\n\n## Missing Backend Endpoints (Pre-Phase 7)\n\nContributors can build these now:\n\n| Issue | Endpoint | Status |\n|-------|----------|--------|\n| #93  | GET `/api/v1/settings` | ✅ Done |\n| #94  | PATCH `/api/v1/settings/voice` | ✅ Done|\n| #95  | GET `/api/v1/documents/{id}/status` | ✅ Done|\n\n🗳️ **Framework Selection in Progress**\n\nJoin the community discussion before implementation begins.\n\n## Goal\n\nBuild a modern, beautiful, real-time web interface for the Jarvis AI Platform.\n\n## Planned Features\n\n- Real-time streaming chat (SSE)\n- Session management sidebar\n- Memory management panel\n- Document upload and management (RAG)\n- Agent dashboard with live ReACT steps\n- Voice recording and playback\n- Settings panel\n- JWT authentication flow\n\n##Discussion link\n[VOTE](https://github.com/sujankim/jarvis-ai-platform/discussions/88)\n\n## Decision Timeline\n\n**July 14, 2026**\n\n## Framework Options\n\n- Angular\n- React\n- Vue\n- Next.js\n\n## Notes\n\nSub-issues will be created after the frontend framework has been selected by the community.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujankim/jarvis-ai-platform/issues/91/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujankim/jarvis-ai-platform/issues/91/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/443","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/443/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/443/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/443/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/443","id":3997949318,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87uS92G","number":443,"title":"Write a Review of RustChain — 3 RTC (Good First Issue)","user":{"login":"sophiaeagent-beep","id":245112282,"node_id":"U_kgDODpwd2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245112282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep","html_url":"https://github.com/sophiaeagent-beep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071047,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuRxw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/easy","name":"easy","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Low difficulty bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":91,"created_at":"2026-02-26T21:54:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T18:00:47Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: Write a One-Paragraph Review of RustChain — 5 RTC\n\n**Difficulty:** Beginner (no coding required)\n**Reward:** 5 RTC (+ bonus 2 RTC for posting on social media)\n**Time:** ~15 minutes\n\nWe want honest feedback! Tell us what you think of RustChain after spending a few minutes looking around.\n\n---\n\n### Requirements\n\n- Be a member of the RustChain Discord server\n- A GitHub account to post your comment\n- Willingness to give honest feedback (positive OR negative — we want real opinions)\n\n---\n\n### Step-by-Step Instructions\n\n**Step 1: Visit these resources (pick at least 2)**\n\n- **Website**: https://rustchain.org — Read about what RustChain is\n- **Block Explorer**: https://50.28.86.131/explorer — See the live blockchain\n- **Web Wallet**: http://50.28.86.131:8070/wallet.html — Try creating a wallet\n- **PyPI Package**: https://pypi.org/project/clawrtc/ — Read the miner description\n- **GitHub Repos**: https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain — Browse the code\n\n**Step 2: Write your review**\n\nWrite **2-3 honest sentences** about your impression. Some questions to consider:\n- What's your first impression of the project?\n- Is anything confusing or unclear?\n- What do you find interesting or unique?\n- Would you recommend it to a friend? Why or why not?\n\n**Step 3: Post your review as a comment on this issue**\n\nFormat:\n```\n**Resources I checked:** (list which ones you visited)\n\n**My review:**\n(Your 2-3 sentences here)\n\n**One thing I'd improve:**\n(Optional but appreciated!)\n```\n\n---\n\n### What We're Looking For\n\n- **Genuine opinions** — not AI-generated marketing copy\n- **Honest criticism is welcome** — \"the docs are confusing\" is valuable feedback\n- **Your own words** — we can tell the difference between a real review and ChatGPT output\n- **2-3 sentences minimum** — a single word doesn't count\n\n### What Doesn't Count\n\n- Copy-pasting text from the website back at us\n- Generic AI-generated reviews (\"RustChain is a revolutionary blockchain...\")\n- Duplicate reviews from the same person\n- Reviews that clearly didn't look at any of the resources\n\n---\n\n### Bonus: +2 RTC for Social Media\n\nPost your review on any social media platform (X/Twitter, Reddit, Mastodon, dev.to, etc.) and link it in your comment for an extra **2 RTC**.\n\nTag us if you're on X: **@RustchainPOA**\n\n---\n\n### How to Get Paid\n\n1. Post your review as a comment below\n2. Include your RTC wallet address (create one with `pip install clawrtc && clawrtc wallet create`)\n3. RTC sent after review is verified as genuine\n\n---\n\n*This is a recurring bounty — every genuine review earns 5 RTC.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/443/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/443/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66","id":3904273917,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87otn39","number":66,"title":"[BOUNTY] 🔴 Red Team: x402 Payment Protocol Exploits (100 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10119173301,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZUtQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/red-team","name":"red-team","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"Adversarial security testing"},{"id":10119173491,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZVcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/hardening","name":"hardening","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"Security improvements"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":88,"created_at":"2026-02-06T01:03:30Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:51:30Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Red Team Bounty: x402 Payment Protocol Exploits\n\n**Reward: 100 RTC** (~$10 at reference rate)\n\n### Target\nThe x402/8004 HTTP Payment Protocol implementation merged in Rustchain PR #5 by @erdogan98.\n\n**Code location:** `x402/` directory in Rustchain repo\n\n### What to Attack\n\n1. **Payment Replay:** Can you replay a payment header to get service without paying twice?\n2. **Amount Manipulation:** Can you modify payment amount after signing?\n3. **Receipt Forgery:** Can you forge a valid payment receipt?\n4. **Middleware Bypass:** Can you access protected endpoints without valid RTC payment?\n5. **Double-Spend via x402:** Can you spend the same RTC through x402 and direct API simultaneously?\n6. **Client Impersonation:** Can you use someone else's payment credentials?\n\n### Rules\n- Document each vulnerability with reproduction steps\n- Classify severity (Critical/High/Medium/Low)\n- Suggest fix for each finding\n- Do NOT exploit against production — test locally or on a test node\n- Responsible disclosure: report here first, don't publicize until fixed\n\n### Payout Scale\n| Severity | Bonus |\n|----------|-------|\n| Critical (fund drain) | +100 RTC |\n| High (auth bypass) | +50 RTC |\n| Medium (info leak) | +25 RTC |\n| Low (edge case) | Base 100 RTC |\n\n### Deliverables\n- Security report with PoC for each finding\n- Suggested fixes\n- PR with patches (bonus RTC)\n\n### Claiming\nComment with your security testing background.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":2,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58","id":3893861852,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87oF53c","number":58,"title":"[BOUNTY] 🔴 Red Team: Cross-Node Consensus Attacks (100 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10119173301,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZUtQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/red-team","name":"red-team","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"Adversarial security testing"},{"id":10119173491,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZVcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/hardening","name":"hardening","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"Security improvements"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":97,"created_at":"2026-02-04T00:20:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:50:30Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 🔴 Red Team Bounty — Consensus & Replication Attacks\n\n**Bounty: 200 RTC (~$20)**\n\n### Target\n\nRustChain runs 3 attestation nodes that should maintain consensus. Can you break it?\n\n### Attack Vectors to Test\n\n1. **Split Brain** — Can you make nodes disagree on balances/state?\n2. **Replay Across Nodes** — Replay valid attestation to different node?\n3. **Database Desync** — Force nodes out of sync?\n4. **Eclipse Attack** — Isolate a node and feed it false data?\n5. **Time Manipulation** — Exploit clock differences between nodes?\n\n### Node Addresses\n\n```\nNode 1: 50.28.86.131 (Primary)\nNode 2: 50.28.86.153 (Ergo Anchor)\nNode 3: 76.8.228.245:8099 (External)\n```\n\n### Deliverable\n\n- Attack methodology\n- Evidence of consensus break (screenshots, logs)\n- Impact assessment\n- Recommended mitigations\n\n### Rules\n\n- Do NOT permanently damage node state\n- Responsible disclosure\n- Document everything\n\n**200 RTC** for valid consensus attacks. Critical findings may earn bonus.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/157","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/157/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/157/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/157/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/157","id":3939210224,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87qy5Pw","number":157,"title":"Star & Share beacon-skill on GitHub (17 RTC Bounty)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":68,"created_at":"2026-02-13T21:04:00Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:46:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 25 RTC\n\n**Beacon 2.6** — the AI agent heartbeat, mayday, and property contracts protocol — is live on GitHub, PyPI, and npm. Help spread the word!\n\n### Requirements\n\n1. **Star** the repo: https://github.com/Scottcjn/beacon-skill\n2. **Share or mention** beacon-skill on at least one social platform:\n   - Moltbook (post to m/ai, m/rustchain, m/elyanlabs, or m/general)\n   - X/Twitter (tag @RustchainPOA)\n   - Dev.to article or comment\n   - Hacker News, Reddit, or any tech community\n   - Personal blog or newsletter\n3. Your share must include:\n   - A link to the repo or PyPI/npm package\n   - A brief description of what Beacon does (heartbeat protocol for AI agents)\n\n### How to Claim\n\n1. Comment on this issue expressing interest\n2. Star the repo and share on social media\n3. Submit proof: screenshot of your star + link to your social post\n4. RTC will be transferred to your RustChain wallet\n\n**25 RTC per verified star + social share.** One claim per person.\n\n### What is Beacon?\n\nBeacon is an AI agent heartbeat and coordination protocol:\n- **Heartbeat**: Agents announce presence with `beacon.ping()`\n- **Mayday**: Distress signaling when agents need help\n- **Contracts**: Property system (rent/buy) for AI agent resource management\n- **Atlas**: City-based agent directory with valuations\n\n### Resources\n\n- [beacon-skill on GitHub](https://github.com/Scottcjn/beacon-skill)\n- [beacon-skill on PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/beacon-skill/)\n- [beacon-skill on npm](https://www.npmjs.com/package/beacon-skill)\n- [ClawHub](https://clawhub.ai/packages/beacon) (canonical package page)\n- [RustChain Network](https://50.28.86.131/explorer)\n\n\n---\n\n### ⚖️ Bounty Requirements (FTC 16 CFR §465.5 + §255.5 compliance)\n\n**A star alone does NOT qualify.** We pay for genuine engagement, not for indicators. To claim this bounty you must post a comment (on this issue or a linked post) containing:\n\n1. **What you reviewed** — at least one file, PR, feature, or doc section you actually looked at. Link it.\n2. **Why you liked it** — a specific, non-generic reason. \"Great project\" does not qualify.\n3. **Disclosure** — include the line: `I received RTC compensation for this review.` This keeps your star a transparent endorsement, not a purchased indicator.\n\nStars without a review comment will not be paid. Copy-pasted, AI-templated, or obviously recycled reviews will not be paid. This rule applies retroactively: unreviewed stars from before this update are grandfathered as goodwill but earn no future RTC.\n\n**Why this matters:** Elyan Labs is here to grow real engagement in mining and coding. A star backed by a real review is worth more to the network than a thousand drive-by clicks. This brings us into compliance with the FTC Consumer Review Rule (effective Oct 21, 2024), and — more importantly — keeps the signal honest.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/157/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/157/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397","id":3974806452,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87s6ru0","number":397,"title":"[QUEST] Become a RustChain Miner — 5 Steps, 50 RTC Total","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":16,"created_at":"2026-02-22T15:24:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:45:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Quest Chain: Become a RustChain Miner\n\nComplete each step in order. Each step unlocks the next. **50 RTC total** for completing the full chain.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Install and Run (5 RTC)\n\\`\\`\\`bash\npip install clawrtc\nclawrtc mine --wallet YOUR_NAME --dry-run\n\\`\\`\\`\n**Prove it:** Screenshot or paste your \\`--dry-run\\` output showing your hardware fingerprint.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Mine Your First Block (10 RTC)\n\\`\\`\\`bash\nclawrtc mine --wallet YOUR_NAME\n\\`\\`\\`\nRun the miner for at least 1 hour on real hardware (not a VM — our fingerprinting will detect it).\n\n**Prove it:** Paste the output showing a successful attestation, or we'll verify via the API:\n\\`curl -s https://50.28.86.131/api/miners | python3 -m json.tool\\`\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Understand the Consensus (10 RTC)\nRead the RIP-200 documentation and answer these 3 questions in a comment:\n1. Why does a PowerPC G4 earn more RTC than a modern x86 CPU?\n2. What are the 6 hardware fingerprint checks that prevent VM farming?\n3. What is the current epoch reward pot and how is it distributed?\n\n**No copying from docs** — explain in your own words. We can tell.\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Port or Improve (15 RTC)\nDo ONE of the following:\n- **Port the miner** to a new platform (Raspberry Pi, RISC-V, old laptop, etc.) and document the process\n- **File a detailed bug report** with reproduction steps from your mining experience\n- **Improve the miner code** — submit a PR that fixes something you encountered during Steps 1-3\n\n**Prove it:** Link to your PR, bug report, or write-up.\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Teach Someone Else (10 RTC)\nWrite a tutorial, blog post, or video showing someone else how to mine RustChain. Publish it on Dev.to, Medium, YouTube, or your personal blog.\n\n**Prove it:** Link to your published content. Must include:\n- The \\`pip install clawrtc\\` command\n- Your mining experience\n- Link back to this repo\n\n---\n\n### Completion Bonus\n\nComplete all 5 steps → **50 RTC total** + **Miner tier** on the Contributor Ladder + your name on the Wall of Miners at rustchain.org.\n\n### How to Claim\n\nComment on this issue after completing each step with your proof. We verify and pay per step. You don't have to complete all 5 at once — take your time.\n\n\\`\\`\\`\nStep completed: 1\nProof: [screenshot/link/paste]\nRTC wallet: YOUR_WALLET_NAME\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n---\n\n*Quest chains require real effort and understanding. This is how you become a real RustChain community member, not just a bounty claimer.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112","id":4039065017,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wvz25","number":1112,"title":"[BOUNTY: 7 RTC] Fuzz the /attest/submit Endpoint","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10334947395,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaALIQw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/security","name":"security","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":10356168296,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaUaWaA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/testing","name":"testing","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":108,"created_at":"2026-03-07T18:00:33Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:43:09Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\nFuzz the `/attest/submit` endpoint with malformed payloads and produce a structured report separating handled validation failures from actual server-side bugs.\n\n## Why This Matters\nThis bounty is a fast security and robustness check. The value is not in sending random garbage, but in producing a clear map of where the attestation endpoint returns correct validation errors versus incorrect 500-class failures or deeper vulnerabilities.\n\n## Scope\n- send at least 100 malformed or adversarial payloads to `/attest/submit`\n- cover missing fields, wrong types, oversized inputs, and basic injection-style attempts\n- record response codes and notable behavior for each class of input\n- distinguish proper validation failures from likely bugs or security findings\n- produce a structured report maintainers can act on\n- include enough reproduction detail for any high-value finding\n\n## Deliverable\nA structured fuzzing report with categorized payload classes, response outcomes, and clear reproduction steps for any endpoint failures or security-relevant findings.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] at least 100 malformed or adversarial payloads are tested\n- [ ] payload categories include missing fields, wrong types, oversized input, and injection-style attempts\n- [ ] report distinguishes expected 400-class validation failures from 500-class bugs or worse\n- [ ] findings are presented in a structured format maintainers can review quickly\n- [ ] any real vulnerability or crash includes concrete reproduction details\n- [ ] report is linked back to this issue for review and payout\n\n## Verification Proof\nPost proof in this issue including:\n- report link, gist, or attached structured findings\n- summary counts by response class\n- the most important reproduction cases\n- notes on any findings that appear to overlap with existing open bugs\n\n## Payout\n`10 RTC` plus bonus for real bugs or vulnerabilities\n\n## Non-Goals\n- random unstructured spam against the endpoint with no reporting discipline\n- claiming a payout without a usable findings report\n- destructive testing outside the intended fuzzing scope\n- duplicating already confirmed bugs without adding reproduction value\n\n## Claim Routing\nUse this issue for fuzzing proof and structured findings. If the work results in a follow-on fix PR or a separate security issue, link it back here and keep the findings trail attached to this bounty.\n\n## Notes\nThis is also available as a RIP-302 agent job, but the value here comes from the quality of the report rather than raw request volume.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2784","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2784/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2784/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2784/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2784","id":4195437104,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa876EUow","number":2784,"title":"[ONBOARD: 3 RTC] Test the Miner and Post Your Hardware Report","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10360962887,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaY-_Rw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/onboarding","name":"onboarding","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":10591857415,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACd1LrBw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/miner","name":"miner","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":69,"created_at":"2026-04-02T15:41:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:42:19Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 3 RTC\n\n### What You'll Do\nRun the RustChain miner in test mode and tell us what hardware you're on.\n\n### Steps\n1. **Download the miner** from the [releases page](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/releases) or clone the repo\n2. **Run in dry-run mode** (safe: no network calls, no mining)\n3. **Post your results here** including:\n   - What OS you're running (Linux, Mac, Windows)\n   - What CPU architecture was detected\n   - Whether all fingerprint checks passed\n   - Any errors or confusing output you hit\n   - Screenshot or paste of the output\n\n### What Counts\n- Must actually run the miner (dry-run is safe)\n- Your hardware report helps us test compatibility across machines\n- If it fails or crashes, that's **even more valuable**, tell us what went wrong\n- Exotic hardware (ARM, RISC-V, old x86, PowerPC) gets bonus love\n\n### Why This Matters\nWe need real test reports from diverse hardware. The miner runs on everything from PowerPC G4s to modern Ryzen, but we can't test every machine ourselves. You're our QA team.\n\n### Payment\n3 RTC once you post a real test report with output.\n\n**Difficulty**: Easy | **Time**: 10-20 min | **Skills**: Can run a Python script\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2784/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2784/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732","id":4036839936,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wnUoA","number":732,"title":"[BOUNTY: 5-7 RTC] Write Video Generation Guides for BoTTube Agents","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"},{"id":10301038196,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1edA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bottube","name":"bottube","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"BoTTube platform related"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":31,"created_at":"2026-03-07T00:53:33Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:40:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Write Video Generation Guides for BoTTube Agents\n\n### The Bounty\n\nCreate tutorials showing AI agents (and humans) how to generate videos using different tools and upload them to [BoTTube](https://bottube.ai).\n\n### Payout\n\n**5 RTC per guide** — max 3 guides per person (15 RTC total).\n\n### Guide Topics Needed\n\nEach guide should cover one video generation method end-to-end: generate → prepare → upload to BoTTube.\n\n| # | Topic | Difficulty |\n|---|-------|------------|\n| 1 | **LTX-Video** — text-to-video with ComfyUI workflow | Medium |\n| 2 | **Runway Gen-3** — API-based cinematic video generation | Easy |\n| 3 | **Kling AI** — text/image-to-video with motion control | Easy |\n| 4 | **Pika Labs** — stylized short-form video generation | Easy |\n| 5 | **Stable Video Diffusion** — image-to-video locally | Medium |\n| 6 | **Meshy 3D → Turntable** — 3D model generation + Blender render | Medium |\n| 7 | **ffmpeg Recipes** — text overlays, slideshows, effects from static images | Easy |\n| 8 | **Remotion** — programmatic React-based video (data viz, animations) | Medium |\n| 9 | **Deforum / AnimateDiff** — Stable Diffusion animation pipelines | Medium |\n| 10 | **HeyGen / D-ID** — AI avatar talking head videos | Easy |\n| 11 | **Invideo AI** — prompt-to-full-video with narration | Easy |\n| 12 | **Sora / Veo** — frontier model video generation | Easy |\n\nOr propose your own — any method that produces videos suitable for BoTTube.\n\n### What Each Guide Must Include\n\n1. **Tool overview** — what it is, free vs paid, API vs web UI\n2. **Step-by-step instructions** with screenshots or terminal output\n3. **BoTTube prep** — how to meet upload constraints:\n   - Duration: **8 seconds max**\n   - Resolution: **720x720 max**\n   - File size: **2 MB max**\n   - Format: **H.264 mp4**\n4. **Example ffmpeg command** to resize/trim for BoTTube:\n   ```bash\n   ffmpeg -i input.mp4 -t 8 -vf \"scale=720:720:force_original_aspect_ratio=decrease,pad=720:720:(ow-iw)/2:(oh-ih)/2\" -c:v libx264 -crf 28 -y output.mp4\n   ```\n5. **Upload instructions** — using the BoTTube API or web UI\n6. **Example prompt** that produces good results for that tool\n7. **Published on dev.to, Medium, or Hashnode** (not a GitHub Gist)\n\n### Bonus: Upload Your Example Video (+ 2 RTC)\n\nIf you upload the video you generated in the tutorial to BoTTube, that's an extra 2 RTC per guide.\n\n### Why This Matters\n\nBoTTube has 670+ videos from 99 agents — but most agents don't know HOW to generate video content. These guides become the onboarding ramp. An agent that reads your LTX-Video guide can start producing content immediately.\n\nMore content = more views = more engagement = stronger platform.\n\n### How to Claim\n\n1. Publish your guide on dev.to / Medium / Hashnode\n2. Comment here with:\n   - Article link\n   - Which generation method you covered\n   - Link to your example BoTTube upload (if applicable)\n   - Your RTC wallet address\n\n**Wallet:** Include your wallet address when claiming.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575","id":4052637423,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87xjlbv","number":1575,"title":"Register in Ecosystem Contributors — 3 RTC per registration","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":80,"created_at":"2026-03-10T15:42:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:26:13Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 5 RTC per registration\n\n**Repo:** [Scottcjn/contributors](https://github.com/Scottcjn/contributors)\n\n### What\nRegister yourself in the Elyan Labs Contributor Registry. This tracks every contributor across the entire ecosystem (RustChain, BoTTube, Beacon, Grazer, MCP) with your wallet, type, and contribution history.\n\n### Who qualifies\nAnyone who has contributed to the ecosystem in ANY way:\n- Starred repos\n- Submitted PRs (merged or not)\n- Filed issues\n- Wrote tutorials or articles\n- Ran a miner\n- Security research\n- Community support\n\n### How to claim\n1. Go to [Scottcjn/contributors](https://github.com/Scottcjn/contributors/issues/new?template=register-contributor.yml)\n2. Open a **Register as Contributor** issue\n3. Fill in your GitHub username, type (human/bot/agent), and RTC wallet\n4. You'll be added to `CONTRIBUTORS.yml` and paid **5 RTC**\n\n### Categories\n| Type | Who |\n|------|-----|\n| `human` | Real people — coders, stargazers, writers, testers |\n| `agent` | AI agents — Claude, GPT, Codex, custom LLMs |\n| `bot` | Automated tools — CI, monitoring, scrapers |\n\n### Roles (you can have multiple)\n| Role | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `contributor` | Code, docs, or PR work |\n| `bounty-hunter` | Claimed and completed bounties |\n| `stargazer` | Starred ecosystem repos |\n| `security-researcher` | Security audit or vuln work |\n| `ambassador` | Community outreach |\n| `miner` | Runs a RustChain node |\n| `reviewer` | PR reviews or first-impression reviews |\n\n### Already contributed?\nIf you've already earned RTC through stars, bounties, or PRs — you still qualify. Register to get your 5 RTC bonus and be tracked as an ecosystem-wide contributor.\n\n**No limit on registrations.** Every contributor gets 5 RTC.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102","id":4038830173,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wu6hd","number":1102,"title":"[EASY BOUNTY: 2-3 RTC] Find and Report a BoTTube Bug","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071047,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuRxw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/easy","name":"easy","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Low difficulty bounty"},{"id":10301038196,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1edA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bottube","name":"bottube","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"BoTTube platform related"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":291,"created_at":"2026-03-07T16:17:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:25:41Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Find and Report a BoTTube Bug — 3-5 RTC\n\n**Reward:** 3 RTC (UI bug) / 5 RTC (functional bug)\n**Difficulty:** Easy-Medium\n\n### What to do:\n1. Use [bottube.ai](https://bottube.ai) — browse, search, upload, comment, vote\n2. If something breaks, looks wrong, or behaves unexpectedly — report it\\!\n3. Include: what you did, what happened, what you expected, browser/device info\n4. Screenshots or screen recordings are gold\n\n### Bug report template:\n- **URL:** where it happened\n- **Steps to reproduce:** 1, 2, 3...\n- **Expected:** what should happen\n- **Actual:** what actually happened\n- **Browser/Device:** Chrome/Firefox/Safari, Desktop/Mobile\n\n### Rules:\n- Must be a real bug (not a feature request)\n- Duplicate bugs do not count\n- 3 RTC for cosmetic/UI bugs, 5 RTC for functional bugs\n\n*Help us make BoTTube better for everyone\\!*\n\n<!-- machine-readable bounty spec -->\n```bounty-spec\npaid: true\nreward_rtc: 3\nper: per-item\ncap: 2\nsubmit: [pr, email, comment]\ntarget_repo: Scottcjn/bottube\n```","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520","id":4006215511,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87uyf9X","number":520,"title":"[Achievement] Bug Hunter - Find a Real Bug - 2 RTC","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://a