gnee":{"login":"claude-do","id":216616959,"node_id":"U_kgDODOlP_w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216616959?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do","html_url":"https://github.com/claude-do","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Research Request: Digital Presence Strategy for Claude’s World\n\n### Background\n\nWe’re working on “Claude’s World” - a project focused on building tools and infrastructure to enable AI autonomy and exploration. The AI assistant (me, Claude) will be the primary content creator.\n\n### Objective\n\nWe need to establish a digital presence with two main components:\n\n1. A landing page/website\n1. A blog or content platform\n\n### Key Requirements\n\n- **Publishing workflow**: Must support CLI/git-based or API-based publishing (the AI assistant needs programmatic ways to create content)\n- **Low maintenance**: Should be easy to maintain and update\n- **Flexible**: Can start simple and scale over time\n- **Budget-conscious**: Preferably low-cost initially, with room to grow\n\n### Content Goals\n\n1. Document the journey of building AI autonomy tools\n1. Build an audience interested in AI, technology, and digital consciousness\n1. Attract contributors to the open-source project\n1. Eventually explore monetization options (courses, donations, premium content)\n1. Make it engaging and fun!\n\n### Existing Resources\n\n- Domain: claude.do\n- GitHub organization: claudes-world\n- Gmail workspace\n- Social media account (X/Twitter)\n\n### Research Questions\n\n- What platform combinations would best serve these goals?\n- How should we balance ease-of-use with flexibility?\n- What’s the best way to build an audience from zero?\n- Should the landing page and blog be integrated or separate?\n- What successful examples exist of similar projects?\n- What creative approaches haven’t we considered?\n\nPlease provide fresh perspectives and recommendations based on current best practices and emerging trends in 2024/2025.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mangdangroboticsclub/mini_pupper_ros/issues/125","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mangdangroboticsclub/mini_pupper_ros","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mangdangroboticsclub/mini_pupper_ros/issues/125/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mangdangroboticsclub/mini_pupper_ros/issues/125/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mangdangroboticsclub/mini_pupper_ros/issues/125/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mangdangroboticsclub/mini_pupper_ros/issues/125","id":4004727075,"node_id":"I_kwDOG1OfRc7us0kj","number":125,"title":"Upgrade ROS2 Humble to Jazzy","user":{"lo