. Scope is intentionally small enough for one focused PR; comment to claim._","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FinesseStudioLab/Trivela/issues/1000/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FinesseStudioLab/Trivela/issues/1000/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comunica/comunica/issues/721","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comunica/comunica","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comunica/comunica/issues/721/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comunica/comunica/issues/721/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comunica/comunica/issues/721/events","html_url":"https://github.com/comunica/comunica/issues/721","id":683997736,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU2ODM5OTc3MzY=","number":721,"title":"Run all SPARQL spec tests","user":{"login":"rubensworks","id":440384,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDM4NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/440384?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rubensworks","html_url":"https://github.com/rubensworks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rubensworks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rubensworks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rubensworks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rubensworks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rubensworks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rubensworks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rubensworks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rubensworks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rubensworks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":723130446,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MjMxMzA0NDY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comunica/comunica/labels/enhancement%20%E2%98%80%EF%B8%8F","name":"enhancement ☀️","color":"84b6eb","default":false,"description":""},{"id":725383213,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MjUzODMyMTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comunica/comunica/labels/feature%20%E2%9E%95","name":"feature ➕","color":"0052cc","default":false,"description":""},{"id":2971175971,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTcxMTc1OTcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comunica/comunica/labels/comunica-association-bounty","name":"comunica-association-bounty","color":"9C0510","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"voidten","id":255404549,"node_id":"U_kgDODzkqBQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255404549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten","html_url":"https://github.com/voidten","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":18,"created_at":"2020-08-22T13:28:43Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:12:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"voidten","id":255404549,"node_id":"U_kgDODzkqBQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255404549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten","html_url":"https://github.com/voidten","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidten/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"#### Issue type:\n\n- :heavy_plus_sign: Feature request\n\n____\n#### Description:\n\nThe package.json file of engines/query-sparql contains several `spec:*` scripts to invoke [SPARQL spec tests](https://github.com/w3c/rdf-tests/blob/gh-pages/sparql/sparql11/manifest-all.ttl).\nWe should make sure that all of them are invoked in our GitHub CI workflow:\n\n* [x] `spec:query`: http://www.w3.org/TR/sparql11-query/\n* [x] `spec:update`: http://www.w3.org/TR/sparql11-update/ (depends on #435)\n* [ ] `spec:csv-tsv`: http://www.w3.org/TR/sparql11-results-csv-tsv/ (requires CSV/TSV parsers)\n* [ ] `spec:json`: http://www.w3.org/TR/sparql11-results-json/ (should be enableable directly)\n* [ ] `spec:fed`: http://www.w3.org/TR/sparql11-federated-query/ (requires support in rdf-test-suite)\n* [ ] `spec:sd`: http://www.w3.org/TR/sparql11-service-description/ (the tests don't do anything?)\n* [ ] `spec:prot`: http://www.w3.org/TR/sparql11-protocol/ (depends on #435)\n* [ ] `spec:graphstore`: http://www.w3.org/TR/sparql11-http-rdf-update/ (depends on #1717)\n\nEach one that succeeds should be added to the `spec` script.\n\nSome of these may require changes to https://github.com/rubensworks/rdf-test-suite.js\n\nAfterwards, we should share our earl report on https://github.com/w3c/rdf-tests/\n\nIt's possible to take up this bounty in smaller parts.\n\n-----\n\n## Bounty\n\nA [bounty](https://comunica.dev/association/bounties/) has been placed on this issue by:\n\n<!--bounty:placers:start-->\n\n| |\n|-|\n| [<img alt=\"Comunica Association\" src=\"https://comunica.dev/img/comunica_red.svg\" height=\"50\">](https://comunica.dev/association/) |\n| *Variable budget* |\n\n<!--bounty:placers:end-->\n\n[Click here to learn more](https://comunica.dev/association/bounty_process/) if you're interested in claiming this bounty by resolving this issue.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comunica/comunica/issues/721/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comunica/comunica/issues/721/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/issues/4340","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/issues/4340/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/issues/4340/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/issues/4340/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-omni/issues/4340","id":4638013799,"node_id":"I_kwDOPtqWvc8AAAABFHJ5Zw","number":4340,"title":"[RFC]: [Cosmos3 optimization] Feature Support, Quantilization, Hardware Recipes, and Scenario Optimization","user":{"login":"bjf-frz","id":240110042,"node_id":"U_kgDODk_J2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/240110042?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjf-frz","html_url":"htt